ts/2018/10/30/commvault-systems-inc-cvlt-q2-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"CVLT 2018 Q3","e":"cvlt","d":"2019-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Neil Robert Hammer","x":"It is important to note that Commvault Advance is a major transformation and restructuring effort where we are making fundamental changes to the business, which carries risk tied to disruption and execution.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/29/commvault-systems-inc-cvlt-q3-2019-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"CVLT 2018 Q3","e":"cvlt","d":"2019-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian Carolan","x":"If we achieve our revenue outlook, we believe we will continue to see strong year-over-year margin expansion and earnings growth based on the cost-cutting initiatives that we undertook in fiscal 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/29/commvault-systems-inc-cvlt-q3-2019-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"CVLT 2018 Q4","e":"cvlt","d":"2019-04-30","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Sanjay Mirchandani","x":"But needless to mention, I've been personally involved with our theater leaders as Gary Merrill, our new VP of Operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/30/commvault-systems-inc-cvlt-q4-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"CVLT 2018 Q4","e":"cvlt","d":"2019-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian Michael Carolan","x":"On a full-year basis, EPS was $1.80, a 76% year-over-year increase driven by growth and repeatable revenue and are successful efforts can rightsizing our cost structure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/30/commvault-systems-inc-cvlt-q4-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"CVLT 2018 Q4","e":"cvlt","d":"2019-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian Michael Carolan","x":"Operating margins were 15.7% for the full fiscal year, improving 480 basis points year-over-year, as we saw some of our early cost reduction initiatives begin to take hold.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/30/commvault-systems-inc-cvlt-q4-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"CVLT 2019 Q1","e":"cvlt","d":"2019-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Andrew Nowinski","x":"And then second, given that subscription growth did slow significantly, I'm trying to understand how you might balance cost-cutting initiatives while managing through that transition to subscriptions and also trying to get growth back on track?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/commvault-systems-inc-cvlt-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"CVLT 2019 Q2","e":"cvlt","d":"2019-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sanjay Mirchandani","x":"We also continue to implement streamline and align the tools and processes to drive predictability and better linearity in our sales pipeline.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/commvault-systems-inc-cvlt-q2-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"CVLT 2019 Q2","e":"cvlt","d":"2019-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian Carolan","x":"After this acquisition our cash balance was just over $310 million of which approximately half reside outside the U.S. As a result of the timing of the Hedvig transaction and other anticipated restructuring costs we did not repurchase any stock during the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/commvault-systems-inc-cvlt-q2-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"CVLT 2019 Q3","e":"cvlt","d":"2020-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian Carolan","x":"First, free cash flow was adversely impacted by approximately $8 million of non-routine severance payments related to recent restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/commvault-systems-inc-cvlt-q3-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"CVLT 2019 Q4","e":"cvlt","d":"2020-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sanjay Mirchandani","x":"Commvault Solution tunes performance across AWS and